{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04128","headline":"拟古三首 二 · 徐彦伯","name":"拟古三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"读书三十载，驰骛周六经。\n儒衣干时主，忠策献阙廷。\n一朝奉休盼，从容厕羣英。\n束身趋建礼，秉笔坐承明。\n廨署相填噎，僚吏纷纵横。\n五日休澣时，屠苏绕玉屏。\n橘花覆北沼，桂树交西荣。\n树栖两鸳鸯，含春向我鸣。\n皎洁绮罗艳，便娟丝管清。\n扰扰天地间，出处各有情。\n何必岩石下，枯槁闲此生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}